Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 05:11:47 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 134/144] phy: qcom-mipi-csi2: complete SM8750 C-PHY
 programming

Keep the PHY ABI separation, three-trio programming and timing divisor together.

Consolidated from local follow-ups:
  a93b2a410ca9a17beac312825c90744295bd8f8c media: qcom: preserve PHY ABI and distinguish C-PHY symbols from bus clocks
  43cce8a3597000d7b0f2012cacabfc9521898985 phy: qcom-mipi-csi2: add SM8750 three-trio C-PHY programming
  ceff075022e0bd85f97265fca6a8aa071464f387 phy: qcom-mipi-csi2: retain the full picosecond timing divisor
